hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"327","It was narrated to us by Bandar bin Bashar, it was narrated to us by Othman bin Omar, it was narrated to us by Malik bin Mughal, on the authority of Al-Walid bin Al-Eizar, on the authority of Abu Amr Al-Shaybani, On the authority of Abdullah bin Masoud, he said: I asked the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace: Which work is best? He said: “Prayer at the beginning of its time.”"
